    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&ldquo;The real deal.&rdquo; – Ron Sexsmith Bad ideas, VCRs, crumbling factories, hairy dogs, questionable tattoos&hellip;all are fair game for Nova Scotian funeral director-turned-songwriter Terra Spencer. And the songs are good ones, judging from the stack of awards her four albums have received, and from the caliber of her collaborators, which include David Francey, Ben Caplan, &hellip;"
      }
