        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A unique performing arts venue located on the beautiful, historic University of Alberta’s’ Augustana Campus in the heart of the province."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "presented by Rapid Fire Theatre Join us before the show at 1:00PM for a pre-show event with the Camrose Public Library in the lobby! Tickets available November 13! Rapid Fire Theatre’s Kidding Around is an interactive, improvised comedy show coming to Camrose and designed for families! Rapid Fire Theatre’s hilarious performers create this entire show …"
