      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "LMS Entertainment Elvis and Dolly: Blue Suede & Rhinestones brings the unforgettable music and charisma of Elvis Presley and Dolly Parton together in one dazzling tribute show. Featuring powerhouse performers, authentic vocals, and all the hits audiences love, this high energy production blends Elvis’s electrifying rock and roll spirit with Dolly’s signature country sparkle. With …"
