    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Looking for a lively and festive performance to kick off the holidays? Look no further than Celtic Roots and Christmas Cheer, a moving concert featuring the award-winning Canadian musical group, Leahy. With deep roots in Canadian folk and Celtic music culture, Leahy will enthrall you with their infectious energy, impressive musicianship, and dynamic performance. Lose &hellip;"
