    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Make sure to stop out in the lobby and say hi to the Leduc Brewing Company and grab a bevvy! In her deeply personal show, My Roots Are Showing, Tracy Millar breathes life into timeless classics from the golden era while weaving in her own soul-searching original tales of love and heartbreak. Whether she is &hellip;"
