    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Get ready for a world of musical madness as lifelong friends Nico Rhodes and Patrick Courtin set off on a divine quest to prove that the piano is the coolest instrument of all time! Armed with 21st-century technology and the greatest music of the last 300 years, this dynamic duo delivers a high-energy “mishmash” featuring &hellip;"
