    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Celebrate the season with a country music legend! Canadian Country Music Hall of Fame inductee Michelle Wright brings her holiday magic to the stage with her special show, &ldquo;Christmas Is Here.&rdquo; With forty major awards, millions of albums sold, and twenty-five Top Ten radio hits, Michelle is one of Canada&rsquo;s most successful and widely recognized &hellip;"
