    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A unique performing arts venue located on the beautiful, historic University of Alberta’s’ Augustana Campus in the heart of the province."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "presented by Paquette Productions Tributes to the Everly Brothers, the Blues Brothers, Motown & Elvis!“Legends Show” brings you some of North America’s most exciting performers live on stage.Accompanied by the “Rockin’ Royals Band”, this show will feature the most incredible Tributes to the Everly Brothers, the Blues Brothers, the Music of Motown, and Elvis Presley. …"
