    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A unique performing arts venue located on the beautiful, historic University of Alberta’s’ Augustana Campus in the heart of the province."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "with special guest, J.J. Shiplett! Make sure to stop out in the lobby and say hi to the Norsemen Brewing Co. and grab a bevvy! Seventeen-time CCMA and two-time JUNO Award winner Tenille Townes has shared the stage with legends like Stevie Nicks, Shania Twain, and Miranda Lambert. Known for her “intensely honest storytelling” and …"
      }
