        "@value": "with special guest, J.J. Shiplett! Make sure to stop out in the lobby and say hi to the Norsemen Brewing Co. and grab a bevvy! Seventeen-time CCMA and two-time JUNO Award winner Tenille Townes has shared the stage with legends like Stevie Nicks, Shania Twain, and Miranda Lambert. Known for her &ldquo;intensely honest storytelling&rdquo; and &hellip;"
