        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A unique performing arts venue located on the beautiful, historic University of Alberta’s’ Augustana Campus in the heart of the province."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Experience a soulful evening of country-folk with Jessie Bird, a rising star from Camrose known for her heartfelt storytelling and themes of resilience. The Grand Prize Winner of the 2026 Alberta Dreams Song Search and a nominee for Roots Artist of the Year at the Country Music Alberta Awards, Jessie has quickly carved out a …"
      }
