        "@value": "A unique performing arts venue located on the beautiful, historic University of Alberta’s’ Augustana Campus in the heart of the province."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join us for an evening of conversation with Hon. Jason Kenney and Dr. Joseph Wiebe, Director of the Chester RonningCentre, exploring the moral and civic questions shaping public life in Canada today. Together they will reflect on themes ofcommunity, belonging, political leadership, religion, and the ethical responsibilities that accompany public service. This public conversation invites …"
