        "@value": "A unique performing arts venue located on the beautiful, historic University of Alberta’s’ Augustana Campus in the heart of the province."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "“The show is particularly beautiful, unique and enchanting.” Catherine Doucet, Ici Radio-Canada Looking for a truly extraordinary theater experience that will captivate audience members of all ages? Welcome to Glob—a magical, gracefully poetic show that blends astonishing acrobatics, mesmerizing juggling, and playful physical comedy into an unforgettable performance. The Story Two mysterious, wonderfully soft and …"
