    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "“The show is particularly beautiful, unique and enchanting.” Catherine Doucet, Ici Radio-Canada Looking for a truly extraordinary theater experience that will captivate audience members of all ages? Welcome to Glob&mdash;a magical, gracefully poetic show that blends astonishing acrobatics, mesmerizing juggling, and playful physical comedy into an unforgettable performance. The Story Two mysterious, wonderfully soft and &hellip;"
      }
